cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite both the paper and this archive."
type: dataset
title: "Replication Package — When Same-Prompt LLM Source Diversity Doesn't Help: An Ablation of Semantic Mutation Operators in Metamorphic Testing for Single-Output Scientific Computing Kernels"
abstract: >
  Replication bundle for the P2 SMS audit paper (IST 2026, under
  review). Contains 12 Programs Under Test, 60 metamorphic-test cells,
  292 confirmed LLM-generated mutants from a 3-LLM cross-source pool
  (Claude Opus 4.6 + GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek V4 Pro), 1,250 cosmic-ray
  syntactic mutants for AST comparison, the full statistical pipeline
  (Cliff's δ, Friedman χ², mixed effects, RQ4 pattern coverage), 5
  reviewer reports per round across two rounds, and the Stage-4.5
  final integrity report. Replication from the committed cache is
  deterministic (SEED=42, temperature=0); no LLM API access required.
